            <div class="row">
            <div class="
                                    col-md-8                                    col-md-push-4
        " data-editor-region-inline>
            <div data-cms-widget="widgets/Block/Block" id="cms-widget-0462247f-7b84-4c41-b961-01c31a5fd280" class="main-content">
                        <div data-editor-region-inline>
            <div data-cms-widget="widgets/Zone/Zone" id="cms-widget-01e32e34-588b-4fe8-a399-843f913c9c05" class="content-zone">
                <div data-cms-widget="widgets/Html/Html" id="cms-widget-359fca2c-869e-403f-84d9-dd74b65fa3e1">
            <h1>Athletics</h1>

<p><strong>About Athletics at Nunez Community College</strong></p>

<p>Nunez Community College is a member of the <a href="http://www.njcaa.org/landing/index" target="_blank">National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA)</a>, region 23.&nbsp;Nunez has fielded a men&#39;s baseball team each year since the 2017-18 academic year. We are excited to bring college baseball to St. Bernard Parish! Play ball!</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<th>
			<p>Sponsors</p>
			</th>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>
			<p><strong>Cole Bordes<br />
			James Polmann, St. Bernard Parish Sheriff<br />
			Jaylynn Turner, St. Bernard Parish Assessor<br />
			Louisiana Knights<br />
			Perry Nicosia, St. Bernard Parish District Attorney<br />
			Valero</strong></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>

<p><strong><em>To support athletics at Nunez Community College with a donation or to become a sponsor, please see the Athletics Fund section of the <a href="/institutional-advancement/nunez-foundation" target="_blank">Nunez Foundation webpage</a>.</em></strong></p>

<p><strong>Want to try-out for the Nunez Baseball Team, click here: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeaEnARgi2yEictzX2LWqxgHrPfI7d-4DUHVteTct4X0QsGyg/viewform" target="_blank" title="Nunez Baseball Questionnaire Form(Opens in New Window)">Baseball Questionnaire Form</a></strong></p>

<p><strong>Spring 2026 Baseball Schedule</strong></p>

<p><strong><img alt="Spring 2026 Baseball Schedule" src="/student-life/files/Athletics/images/SpringSchedule2026.jpg?mask=32" /></strong></p>

<p><strong><a href="/student-life/files/Athletics/documents/Spring_Schedule_2026.pdf" target="_blank" title="Spring 2026 Baseball Schedule(Opens in New Window)">Spring 2026 Baseball Schedule: Click Here for Printable Schedule (PDF)</a></strong></p>

<p><strong>Spring 2026 Baseball Team Roster</strong></p>

<p><strong><img alt="Spring 2025 Baseball Team Roster" src="/student-life/files/Athletics/images/Nunez_Baseball_Spring_2025_Roster.jpg?mask=128" /></strong></p>

<p><strong><a href="/student-life/files/Athletics/documents/Nunez_Baseball_Spring_2025_Roster.pdf" target="_blank" title="Spring 2025 Baseball Team Roster(Opens in New Window)">Spring 2025 Baseball Team Roster: Click Here for Printable Roster (PDF)</a></strong></p>

<h2><strong>For Latest News, <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/429952107534242" target="_blank" title="Nunez Baseball Fan Club Facebook Page(Opens in New Window)">click here</a>!</strong></h2>

<p><strong>Check us out on Social Media:</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61554794390120" target="_blank" title="Nunez Pelicans Baseball Facebook Page(Opens in New Window)">Facebook</a></li>
	<li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/nunezccbaseball/" target="_blank" title="Nunez Pelicans Baseball Instagram Page(Opens in New Window)">Instagram</a></li>
	<li><a href="https://twitter.com/NunezCCBaseball" target="_blank" title="Nunez Pelicans Baseball X Page(Opens in New Window)">X</a></li>
	<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@NunezPelicansBaseball" target="_blank" title="Nunez Pelicans Baseball YouTube Page(Opens in New Window)">YouTube</a></li>
</ul>

<p>At this time, men&#39;s baseball is our only intercollegiate athletics team. Students interested in other sports should make their interest known to Vice Chancellor for Education, Training, and Student Success, Dr. Cherie &#39;Kay&#39; LaRocca at <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#53303f32213c303032133d263d36297d363726" title="Cherie LaRocca Email Address"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="8be8e7eaf9e4e8e8eacbe5fee5eef1a5eeeffe">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</p>

<p><strong>Contact the Coach!</strong><br />
Glenn Powell is serving as the head coach of Nunez Community College&#39;s baseball team. Email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#95f7f4e6f0f7f4f9f9d5fbe0fbf0efbbf0f1e0"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="137172607671727f7f537d667d76693d767766">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> or call (504) 512-0536.</p>

<p><strong>NJCAA (National Junior College Athletic Association) Compliance Documents</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li><a href="/student-life/files/athletics/documents/njcaa%20article%20xviii%20-%20sportsmanship.pdf" target="_blank">NJCAA Article XVIII - Sportsmanship</a></li>
	<li><a href="/student-life/files/athletics/documents/njcaa%20certified%20learning%20disability%20request%20form.pdf" target="_blank">NJCAA Certified Learning Disability Request Form</a></li>
	<li><a href="/student-life/files/athletics/documents/njcaa_eligibility%20affidavit.pdf" target="_blank">NJCAA Eligibility Affidavit</a></li>
	<li><a href="/student-life/files/Athletics/documents/NJCAA_Physical_Examination_Form_5-9-18.pdf" target="_blank">NJCAA Physical Examination Form</a></li>
	<li><a href="/student-life/files/athletics/documents/njcaa%20prospective%20student%20brochure%2017-18.pdf" target="_blank">NJCAA Prospective Student Brochure 2017-2018</a></li>
	<li><a href="/student-life/files/athletics/documents/njcaa%20transfer%20waiver%20form%20-%20new.pdf" target="_blank">NJCAA Transfer Waiver Form</a></li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Nondiscrimination Statement</strong><br />
In keeping with its responsibilities as an educational institution, Nunez Community College is committed to a policy of affording equal opportunity to all of its employees, students, applicants for employment and applicants for admission without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, age, sex, sexual orientation, height, weight, genetic information, or marital status. The College is also committed to a policy of educating and employing disabled individuals and veterans without discrimination.</p>

<p>Contact the Title IX Coordinator with any questions or concerns about equal opportunity at Nunez Community College.</p>

<p>Title IX Coordinator:<br />
Jacinta Massey<br />
<a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#0c66616d7f7f69754c627962697622696879" title="Jacinta Massey Email Address"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="dbb1b6baa8a8bea29bb5aeb5bea1f5bebfae">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><br />
504-278-6278</p>

<p>For assistance with ADA accommodations or questions about disability services, contact Nunez Community College&#39;s Disability Services and Testing Center Coordinator.</p>

<p>ADA Coordinator:<br />
Jacinta Massey<br />
<a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#751f18140606100c351b001b100f5b101100" title="Jacinta Massey Email Address"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="482225293b3b2d3108263d262d32662d2c3d">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><br />
(504) 278-6278</p>

<ul>
	<li><a class="Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act (EADA) 2020-21 Report(Opens in New Window)" href="/student-life/files/Athletics/documents/Nunez_2020-21_EADA_Report.pdf" target="_blank">Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act (EADA) 2020-21 Report</a></li>
	<li><a class="Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act (EADA) 2021-22 Report(Opens in New Window)" href="/student-life/files/Athletics/documents/Nunez_2021-2022_EADA_Report.pdf" target="_blank">Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act (EADA) 2021-22 Report</a></li>
	<li><a href="/student-life/files/Athletics/documents/2025_EADA_Survey.pdf" target="_blank" title="Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act (EADA) 2025 Survey(Opens in New Window)">Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act (EADA) 2025 Survey</a></li>
	<li><a href="/student-life/files/Athletics/documents/2026_EADA.pdf" target="_blank" title="Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act (EADA) 2026 Survey(Opens in New Window)">Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act (EADA) 2026 Survey</a></li>
</ul>

    </div>


